{"seq":3,"slug":"isolates-ffi","title":"Isolates 与 FFI：多核并行与 C/Rust 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/advanced/isolates-ffi","wordCount":869,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"isolates-与-ffi-多核并行与-c-rust-互操作\">Isolates 与 FFI：多核并行与 C/Rust 互操作</h1><p>Flutter 应用运行在 Dart VM 中，默认是单线程的 Event Loop 模型。面对 CPU 密集型计算（图像处理、音视频编解码、机器学习推理）或需要调用高性能 C/Rust 库的场景，Dart 提供了两套突破机制：<strong>Isolate</strong>（独立执行单元）和 <strong>dart:ffi</strong>（外部函数接口）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Isolate</strong></td>\n<td>Dart 的独立执行单元，拥有独立内存堆，通过消息传递通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>SendPort / ReceivePort</strong></td>\n<td>Isolate 间的通信端点，消息传递时值被深度拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>TransferableTypedData</strong></td>\n<td>可以零拷贝传递给 Isolate 的大块二进制数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>dart:ffi</strong></td>\n<td>Dart 外部函数接口，允许直接调用 C 语言函数和结构体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>NativeCallable</strong></td>\n<td>Dart 函数作为 C 回调传递给原生代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Pointer</strong></td>\n<td>dart:ffi 中指向原生内存的指针类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Struct / Union</strong></td>\n<td>dart:ffi 中映射 C struct 和 union 的 Dart 类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ffigen</strong></td>\n<td>从 C 头文件自动生成 dart:ffi 绑定代码的工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"isolate-深度使用模式\">Isolate 深度使用模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-一次性任务-isolate-run\">模式一：一次性任务（Isolate.run）</h3><p><code>Isolate.run()</code> 是 Dart 3.x 的简洁 API，适合不需要持续通信的一次性 CPU 任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 在 Isolate 中处理大型图像&#10;Future&lt;Uint8List&gt; applyFilter(&#10;  Uint8List imageBytes,&#10;  FilterType filter,&#10;) async {&#10;  return Isolate.run(() {&#10;    // 这段代码在独立 Isolate 中运行&#10;    final image = decodeImage(imageBytes);&#10;    return switch (filter) {&#10;      FilterType.grayscale =&gt; applyGrayscale(image),&#10;      FilterType.blur =&gt; applyBlur(image, sigma: 3.0),&#10;      FilterType.sharpen =&gt; applySharpen(image),&#10;    };&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 Isolate 中处理大型图像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;Uint8List> applyFilter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Uint8List imageBytes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  FilterType filter,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Isolate.run(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 这段代码在独立 Isolate 中运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final image = decodeImage(imageBytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return switch (filter) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      FilterType.grayscale => applyGrayscale(image),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      FilterType.blur => applyBlur(image, sigma: 3.0),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      FilterType.sharpen => applySharpen(image),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式二-长期-worker-isolate\">模式二：长期 Worker Isolate</h3><p>对于需要持续复用的计算 Worker，维持 Isolate 避免频繁启动开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// worker_isolate.dart&#10;class ImageProcessorWorker {&#10;  SendPort? _sendPort;&#10;  Isolate? _isolate;&#10;  final _completerMap = &lt;int, Completer&lt;Uint8List&gt;&gt;{};&#10;  int _nextId = 0;&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; start() async {&#10;    final receivePort = ReceivePort();&#10;    _isolate = await Isolate.spawn(&#10;      _workerEntryPoint,&#10;      receivePort.sendPort,&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    // 等待 Worker 就绪，接收其 SendPort&#10;    _sendPort = await receivePort.first as SendPort;&#10;&#10;    // 监听结果&#10;    receivePort.skip(1).listen((message) {&#10;      final [id as int, result as Uint8List] = message as List;&#10;      _completerMap.remove(id)?.complete(result);&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;Uint8List&gt; process(Uint8List bytes, FilterType filter) {&#10;    final completer = Completer&lt;Uint8List&gt;();&#10;    final id = _nextId++;&#10;    _completerMap[id] = completer;&#10;    _sendPort!.send([id, bytes, filter.name]);&#10;    return completer.future;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void dispose() {&#10;    _isolate?.kill(priority: Isolate.immediate);&#10;    _isolate = null;&#10;    _sendPort = null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Worker Isolate 入口点（必须是顶层函数）&#10;void _workerEntryPoint(SendPort mainSendPort) {&#10;  final receivePort = ReceivePort();&#10;  mainSendPort.send(receivePort.sendPort);&#10;&#10;  receivePort.listen((message) {&#10;    final [id as int, bytes as Uint8List, filterName as String] = message as List;&#10;    final filter = FilterType.values.byName(filterName);&#10;&#10;    final image = decodeImage(bytes);&#10;    final result = applyFilter(image, filter);&#10;    mainSendPort.send([id, result]);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// worker_isolate.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ImageProcessorWorker {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SendPort? _sendPort;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Isolate? _isolate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final _completerMap = &#x3C;int, Completer&#x3C;Uint8List>>{};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int _nextId = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> start() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final receivePort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _isolate = await Isolate.spawn(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _workerEntryPoint,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      receivePort.sendPort,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 等待 Worker 就绪，接收其 SendPort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _sendPort = await receivePort.first as SendPort;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 监听结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    receivePort.skip(1).listen((message) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final [id as int, result as Uint8List] = message as List;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _completerMap.remove(id)?.complete(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;Uint8List> process(Uint8List bytes, FilterType filter) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final completer = Completer&#x3C;Uint8List>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final id = _nextId++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _completerMap[id] = completer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _sendPort!.send([id, bytes, filter.name]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return completer.future;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void dispose() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _isolate?.kill(priority: Isolate.immediate);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _isolate = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _sendPort = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Worker Isolate 入口点（必须是顶层函数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void _workerEntryPoint(SendPort mainSendPort) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final receivePort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mainSendPort.send(receivePort.sendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  receivePort.listen((message) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final [id as int, bytes as Uint8List, filterName as String] = message as List;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final filter = FilterType.values.byName(filterName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final image = decodeImage(bytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final result = applyFilter(image, filter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mainSendPort.send([id, result]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"零拷贝传递大型数据\">零拷贝传递大型数据</h3><p>默认情况下，Isolate 间传递数据时会深度拷贝，对于大型 <code>Uint8List</code>（如高清图像）开销可观。使用 <code>TransferableTypedData</code> 实现零拷贝传输：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 发送侧：将 Uint8List 转为可转移对象&#10;final transferable = TransferableTypedData.fromList([largeImageBytes]);&#10;sendPort.send(transferable);&#10;&#10;// 接收侧：物化回 Uint8List（此时原 transferable 失效）&#10;final bytes = (message as TransferableTypedData).materialize()&#10;    .asUint8List();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 发送侧：将 Uint8List 转为可转移对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final transferable = TransferableTypedData.fromList([largeImageBytes]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sendPort.send(transferable);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 接收侧：物化回 Uint8List（此时原 transferable 失效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final bytes = (message as TransferableTypedData).materialize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .asUint8List();</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"dart-ffi-与-c-rust-直接互操作\">dart:ffi：与 C/Rust 直接互操作</h2><p><code>dart:ffi</code> 允许 Dart 代码直接调用编译为动态库（.so / .dylib / .dll）的 C 函数，无需通过 Platform Channel。这在以下场景有明显优势：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph DartSide[&quot;Dart 侧&quot;]&#10;    DF[&quot;dart:ffi\\nPointer / Struct / lookupFunction&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph NativeSide[&quot;原生侧&quot;]&#10;    CLib[&quot;C / C++ / Rust\\n动态库 .so/.dylib&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  DF &lt;--&gt;|&quot;零开销直接调用\\n无序列化&quot;| CLib\">graph LR\n  subgraph DartSide[\"Dart 侧\"]\n    DF[\"dart:ffi\\nPointer / Struct / lookupFunction\"]\n  end\n  subgraph NativeSide[\"原生侧\"]\n    CLib[\"C / C++ / Rust\\n动态库 .so/.dylib\"]\n  end\n  DF &lt;--&gt;|\"零开销直接调用\\n无序列化\"| CLib</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>Platform Channel</th>\n<th>dart:ffi</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调用频率</td>\n<td>低频调用（&lt; 1000 次/秒）</td>\n<td>高频调用（百万次/秒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟要求</td>\n<td>非实时（≥ 1ms）</td>\n<td>实时（&lt; 1µs）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据量</td>\n<td>小数据</td>\n<td>大型二进制数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>需要平台特定实现</td>\n<td>单一 C 接口，跨平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"手动绑定示例\">手动绑定示例</h3><p>以调用一个简单的 C 加密库为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// crypto.h（C 头文件）&#10;#include &lt;stdint.h&gt;&#10;&#10;typedef struct {&#10;  uint8_t* data;&#10;  uint32_t length;&#10;} ByteBuffer;&#10;&#10;ByteBuffer* encrypt(const uint8_t* plaintext, uint32_t length, const uint8_t* key);&#10;void free_buffer(ByteBuffer* buffer);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// crypto.h（C 头文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;stdint.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typedef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  uint8_t*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} ByteBuffer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ByteBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encrypt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint8_t*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> plaintext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint8_t*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> free_buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ByteBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// crypto_ffi.dart（手动 FFI 绑定）&#10;import &#39;dart:ffi&#39;;&#10;import &#39;dart:io&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:ffi/ffi.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 映射 C struct&#10;final class ByteBuffer extends Struct {&#10;  external Pointer&lt;Uint8&gt; data;&#10;&#10;  @Uint32()&#10;  external int length;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 加载动态库&#10;final DynamicLibrary _lib = () {&#10;  if (Platform.isAndroid) return DynamicLibrary.open(&#39;libcrypto.so&#39;);&#10;  if (Platform.isIOS) return DynamicLibrary.process();&#10;  throw UnsupportedError(&#39;Unsupported platform&#39;);&#10;}();&#10;&#10;// 绑定 C 函数&#10;typedef _EncryptNative = Pointer&lt;ByteBuffer&gt; Function(&#10;  Pointer&lt;Uint8&gt;, Uint32, Pointer&lt;Uint8&gt;&#10;);&#10;typedef _EncryptDart = Pointer&lt;ByteBuffer&gt; Function(&#10;  Pointer&lt;Uint8&gt;, int, Pointer&lt;Uint8&gt;&#10;);&#10;&#10;final _encrypt = _lib.lookupFunction&lt;_EncryptNative, _EncryptDart&gt;(&#39;encrypt&#39;);&#10;final _freeBuffer = _lib.lookupFunction&lt;&#10;  Void Function(Pointer&lt;ByteBuffer&gt;),&#10;  void Function(Pointer&lt;ByteBuffer&gt;)&#10;&gt;(&#39;free_buffer&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 封装为 Dart 友好的 API&#10;Uint8List encryptData(Uint8List plaintext, Uint8List key) {&#10;  final plaintextPtr = malloc&lt;Uint8&gt;(plaintext.length);&#10;  final keyPtr = malloc&lt;Uint8&gt;(key.length);&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    plaintextPtr.asTypedList(plaintext.length).setAll(0, plaintext);&#10;    keyPtr.asTypedList(key.length).setAll(0, key);&#10;&#10;    final resultPtr = _encrypt(plaintextPtr, plaintext.length, keyPtr);&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;      final length = resultPtr.ref.length;&#10;      return Uint8List.fromList(resultPtr.ref.data.asTypedList(length));&#10;    } finally {&#10;      _freeBuffer(resultPtr);&#10;    }&#10;  } finally {&#10;    malloc.free(plaintextPtr);&#10;    malloc.free(keyPtr);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// crypto_ffi.dart（手动 FFI 绑定）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:ffi';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:io';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:ffi/ffi.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 映射 C struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class ByteBuffer extends Struct {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external Pointer&#x3C;Uint8> data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @Uint32()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external int length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 加载动态库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final DynamicLibrary _lib = () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (Platform.isAndroid) return DynamicLibrary.open('libcrypto.so');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (Platform.isIOS) return DynamicLibrary.process();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  throw UnsupportedError('Unsupported platform');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 绑定 C 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>typedef _EncryptNative = Pointer&#x3C;ByteBuffer> Function(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Pointer&#x3C;Uint8>, Uint32, Pointer&#x3C;Uint8></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>typedef _EncryptDart = Pointer&#x3C;ByteBuffer> Function(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Pointer&#x3C;Uint8>, int, Pointer&#x3C;Uint8></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final _encrypt = _lib.lookupFunction&#x3C;_EncryptNative, _EncryptDart>('encrypt');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final _freeBuffer = _lib.lookupFunction&#x3C;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Void Function(Pointer&#x3C;ByteBuffer>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void Function(Pointer&#x3C;ByteBuffer>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>>('free_buffer');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 封装为 Dart 友好的 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Uint8List encryptData(Uint8List plaintext, Uint8List key) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final plaintextPtr = malloc&#x3C;Uint8>(plaintext.length);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final keyPtr = malloc&#x3C;Uint8>(key.length);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    plaintextPtr.asTypedList(plaintext.length).setAll(0, plaintext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    keyPtr.asTypedList(key.length).setAll(0, key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final resultPtr = _encrypt(plaintextPtr, plaintext.length, keyPtr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final length = resultPtr.ref.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return Uint8List.fromList(resultPtr.ref.data.asTypedList(length));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _freeBuffer(resultPtr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    malloc.free(plaintextPtr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    malloc.free(keyPtr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-ffigen-自动生成绑定\">使用 ffigen 自动生成绑定</h3><p>对于大型 C 库，手写绑定代价极高。<code>ffigen</code> 工具从 C 头文件自动生成 Dart 绑定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ffigen.yaml&#10;output: &#39;lib/src/generated/crypto.g.dart&#39;&#10;name: &#39;CryptoLibrary&#39;&#10;&#10;headers:&#10;  entry-points:&#10;    - &#39;native/include/crypto.h&#39;&#10;&#10;compiler-opts:&#10;  - &#39;-I/usr/local/include&#39;&#10;&#10;functions:&#10;  include:&#10;    - &#39;encrypt&#39;&#10;    - &#39;decrypt&#39;&#10;    - &#39;free_buffer&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ffigen.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lib/src/generated/crypto.g.dart'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CryptoLibrary'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  entry-points</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'native/include/crypto.h'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">compiler-opts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-I/usr/local/include'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">functions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  include</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'encrypt'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'decrypt'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'free_buffer'</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"dart run ffigen --config ffigen.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ffigen</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ffigen.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"在-isolate-中使用-ffi\">在 Isolate 中使用 FFI</h2><p><code>dart:ffi</code> 调用是<strong>同步阻塞</strong>的——C 函数执行期间会阻塞当前 Isolate。对于耗时的 C 计算，应在 Worker Isolate 中调用 FFI：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"Future&lt;Uint8List&gt; encryptInBackground(&#10;  Uint8List plaintext,&#10;  Uint8List key,&#10;) async {&#10;  return Isolate.run(() {&#10;    // 在独立 Isolate 中调用同步 FFI&#10;    return encryptData(plaintext, key);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;Uint8List> encryptInBackground(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Uint8List plaintext,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Uint8List key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Isolate.run(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 在独立 Isolate 中调用同步 FFI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return encryptData(plaintext, key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"native-assets-dart-3-3\">Native Assets（Dart 3.3+）</h2><p>Dart 3.3 引入了 <strong>Native Assets</strong> 功能，允许在 <code>pubspec.yaml</code> 中声明 C 库，构建时自动编译和打包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pubspec.yaml&#10;dependencies:&#10;  native_assets_cli: ^0.9.0&#10;&#10;# hook/build.dart（构建脚本）&#10;void main(List&lt;String&gt; args) async {&#10;  await build(args, (config, output) async {&#10;    final sourceFiles = [&#10;      &#39;src/crypto.c&#39;,&#10;      &#39;src/aes.c&#39;,&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    final library = await buildCLibrary(&#10;      config,&#10;      name: &#39;crypto&#39;,&#10;      sources: sourceFiles,&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    output.addAsset(NativeCodeAsset(&#10;      package: config.packageName,&#10;      name: &#39;libcrypto.so&#39;,&#10;      linkMode: DynamicLoadingBundled(),&#10;      os: config.targetOS,&#10;      file: library,&#10;    ));&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pubspec.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  native_assets_cli</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^0.9.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># hook/build.dart（构建脚本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">void main(List&#x3C;String> args) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  await build(args, (config, output) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    final sourceFiles = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'src/crypto.c'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'src/aes.c'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    final library = await buildCLibrary(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'crypto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      sources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sourceFiles,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    output.addAsset(NativeCodeAsset(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">config.packageName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'libcrypto.so'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      linkMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DynamicLoadingBundled(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      os</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">config.targetOS,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">library,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能基准对比\">性能基准对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用方式</th>\n<th>典型延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接 Dart 函数调用</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.01µs</td>\n<td>任何场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dart:ffi 调用</td>\n<td>0.1 - 1µs</td>\n<td>高频原生计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Platform Channel</td>\n<td>0.5 - 2ms</td>\n<td>低频平台调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Isolate.run（启动+通信）</td>\n<td>5 - 20ms</td>\n<td>一次性 CPU 任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期 Worker Isolate 消息</td>\n<td>0.1 - 0.5ms</td>\n<td>持续 CPU 任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Dart 的并行计算体系由两个正交维度组成：<strong>Isolate</strong>（隔离内存 + 消息传递，适合 CPU 密集的纯 Dart 计算）和 <strong>dart:ffi</strong>（零开销 C 互操作，适合高频调用或复用成熟 C/Rust 库）。实践中，<code>compute()</code> / <code>Isolate.run()</code> 解决 80% 的并行需求；对延迟敏感的高频计算或需要调用 C 库的场景，<code>dart:ffi</code> + Worker Isolate 是组合方案；<code>ffigen</code> + Native Assets 的组合使 C 库集成从繁琐变成可维护。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/dart-runtime-concurrency\">Dart 运行时与并发模型</a> — Isolate 的基础概念与 Event Loop 关系</li>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/platform-channels\">Platform Channel 通信</a> — 与 dart:ffi 的对比：适用场景与权衡</li>\n<li><a href=\"../production/performance-profiling\">性能分析与优化</a> — 用 DevTools 分析 Isolate 和 FFI 调用的性能</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Isolates 与 FFI：多核并行与 C/Rust 互操作","id":"isolates-与-ffi-多核并行与-c-rust-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Isolate 深度使用模式","id":"isolate-深度使用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：一次性任务（Isolate.run）","id":"模式一-一次性任务-isolate-run"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：长期 Worker Isolate","id":"模式二-长期-worker-isolate"},{"level":3,"text":"零拷贝传递大型数据","id":"零拷贝传递大型数据"},{"level":2,"text":"dart:ffi：与 C/Rust 直接互操作","id":"dart-ffi-与-c-rust-直接互操作"},{"level":3,"text":"手动绑定示例","id":"手动绑定示例"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 ffigen 自动生成绑定","id":"使用-ffigen-自动生成绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"在 Isolate 中使用 FFI","id":"在-isolate-中使用-ffi"},{"level":2,"text":"Native Assets（Dart 3.3+）","id":"native-assets-dart-3-3"},{"level":2,"text":"性能基准对比","id":"性能基准对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Platform Views 嵌入：在 Flutter 中集成原生视图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/advanced/platform-views-embedding"},"next":{"title":"性能分析与优化：DevTools、Impeller 与 Jank 诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/production/performance-profiling"}}